# Privacy Policy for Family Finance Tracker

**Effective Date:** November 24, 2026  
**Developer:** Bhargav Kallepally  
**Contact Email:** bhargavkallepally9@gmail.com  

## 1. Overview
Family Finance Tracker ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal and financial information. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and safeguarded when you use the Family Finance Tracker mobile application (the "App").

## 2. Information We Collect
* **Financial & Budget Data:** Expense entries, income records, budget categories, savings goals, and notes that you voluntarily enter into the App to track family finances.
* **Account Information (If Applicable):** If you create an account or enable family sharing/cloud backup, we may collect your name and email address for authentication and syncing purposes. *(Remove this bullet if your app works completely offline without user accounts.)*
* **Device & Diagnostic Data:** Basic crash logs and performance metrics used solely to improve app stability and fix bugs.

## 3. How We Store Your Data
* **Local Storage / Cloud Sync:** All financial records entered into Family Finance Tracker are stored [locally on your device / securely on encrypted cloud servers]. We do not access, read, or monitor your personal financial transactions.
* **No Bank Credential Access:** The App does not ask for, collect, or store your bank account passwords, UPI PINs, or credit/debit card numbers.

## 4. How We Use Your Information
We use the information strictly to:
* Provide core budgeting, expense tracking, and financial reporting features.
* Sync shared budgets across authorized family members *(if applicable)*.
* Respond to customer support inquiries sent to **bhargavkallepally9@gmail.com**.

## 5. Data Sharing & Third Parties
We **do not sell, rent, or trade** your personal or financial data to third parties, advertisers, or data brokers. Data is only shared with trusted infrastructure providers (such as cloud hosting or analytics services) strictly as necessary to operate the App, or when required by law.

## 6. Data Retention & Deletion
You remain in full control of your data:
* You can edit or delete your financial entries at any time directly within the App.
* Uninstalling the App removes locally stored data from your device.
* To request complete deletion of any cloud-synced account data, email us at **bhargavkallepally9@gmail.com**, and we will process your request within 7 business days.

## 7. Children's Privacy
Family Finance Tracker is intended for general audiences and does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13 without parental consent.

## 8. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will be reflected on this page with a revised Effective Date.

